.TH NN-TENSORS 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-tensors \- list tensors in a model
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn tensors [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List tensors with optional filters.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-weights
Constants only.
.TP
.B \-\-activations
Non-constants only.
.TP
.B \-\-inputs
Model inputs.
.TP
.B \-\-outputs
Model outputs.
.TP
.B \-\-largest
Sort by size descending.
.TP
.B \-\-dtype TYPE
Filter by dtype.
.TP
.B \-\-name PATTERN
Substring match on name.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn tensors model.onnx --largest
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-inspect(1), nn-io(1)
